sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Player
  participant Web as Web UI
  participant CLI as CLI Client
  participant API as Backend API (Fastify)
  participant Game as GameService
  participant AI as AiMoveService
  participant Bedrock as AWS Bedrock Runtime

  Note over API: No auth or webhooks for the POC

  rect rgb(227,242,253)
    User->>Web: Start new game
    Web->>API: POST /v1/new-game
    API->>Game: newGame(startingPlayer, opponentId)
    Game-->>API: GameState
    API-->>Web: GameState
  end

  rect rgb(255,243,224)
    User->>Web: Click cell
    Web->>API: POST /v1/move {state, playerMoveIndex}
    API->>Game: applyPlayerMove(state, playerMoveIndex)
    Game->>AI: getAiMove(state)
    loop retry up to 3 on invalid output
      AI->>Bedrock: InvokeModel(prompt)
      Bedrock-->>AI: JSON {moveIndex, rationale}
    end
    AI-->>Game: moveIndex + rationale
    Game-->>API: MoveResponse
    API-->>Web: MoveResponse
  end

  alt CLI usage
    User->>CLI: Start/move
    CLI->>API: POST /v1/new-game or /v1/move
    API-->>CLI: GameState/MoveResponse or ErrorResponse
  end

  alt Invalid input or invalid move
    API-->>Web: ErrorResponse (400/409/5xx)
  end
